!Name: reflectors-180
!CSome 180-degree glider reflectors.
!CThe numbers to the left are the number of half-diagonals
!Cthat the gliders are displaced.
!CThe numbers above are the "class", and indicate the
!Crelative phase and position of the reflected glider.
!C(Reflectors with a displacement of 0 have two classes,
!Cbecause they can be reflected across a diagonal.)
